        "heading_accent": "not quite yourself?",
        "para_1": "Some mornings you wake up already uncomfortable. Trousers that fit on Monday don't fit by Thursday. You're tired in a way that a full night's sleep doesn't touch, and the only word that fits is sluggish.\n \n<br><br>\n <strong> Alki Detox with Moringa was blended as the opposite of all that. </strong>",
